1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
I'm your China Travel Expert.
我是你的中国旅游专家

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:04,000
You'll never buy a subway ticket in China.
在中国不用买地铁票

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,400
Your phone IS the ticket.
手机就是你的车票

4
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:08,800
Open Alipay or WeChat, tap the transit QR.
打开支付宝或微信，点乘车码

5
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:11,200
Scan going in — and scan going out.
进站扫一下，出站再扫

6
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:13,600
The fare's by distance, deducted automatically.
按里程算钱，自动扣费

7
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:16,000
Most rides cost just 3 to 5 yuan.
大多数只要3到5块

8
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,400
One QR code works in 200+ Chinese cities.
一个码，通行200多城

9
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:20,600
Double-tap if you'd ride this line.
想坐这条线的点个赞

10
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:23,400
★ Expert Tip: set up the transit QR on home wifi — it needs passport verification.
内行提示：出发前在家绑好乘车码

11
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:26,000
Buy a token or just scan — which would you do?
你会买票还是扫码？评论区见
